I'm guessing it would depend on:

- [ ] the number of changes in the PR and;
- [ ] if they are portable to other web technologies (or JWT is a web technology specific new "Vx" heading) and;
- [ ] the number of forks are manageable i.e. reducing the number of forks to those aligned to major compliance standards such as https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS/issues/317#issuecomment-883844517 and https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS/issues/1039 for example.

We can apply the above criteria when the PR is made @csfreak92
